  "comment": "If your looking for a virtual audio cable (VAC), that's free, open source and works on Linux, Windows and OSX check out jackaudio. you can download the source code from http://jackaudio.org/downloads/ Or you can install it via apt-get: sudo apt-get install jack A Gui tool to use is qjackctl sudo apt-get install qjackctl A quick start for jack can be found http://www.64studio.com/quickstart_jack",
